--- !u!114 &1620032079
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1620032076}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: dde86f84792f91f4989544a6d4e6ef36, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  conditionalDialogues:
  - requiredFlag: SilvioBeatenToRoof
    dialogues:
    - name: Evangalic
      sentences:
      - "Strange thing\u2026 seeing a boy bleed for someone else up here."
    flagToSetOnComplete: StartTalkWithEvangalic
  - requiredFlag: StartTalkWithEvangalic
    dialogues:
    - name: Carlo
      sentences:
      - I did what had to be done...
    - name: Evangalic
      sentences:
      - "Spirit like that\u2026 rare on this roof. You step in for a man you\u2019ve
        barely known a month \u2014 that\u2019s not weakness, boy. That\u2019s strength.
        In the eyes of God, helping another is the noblest act of all."
    - name: Carlo
      sentences:
      - What are you getting at?
    - name: Evangelic
      sentences:
      - "Let\u2019s just say\u2026 there\u2019s a way to walk a better path. Not
        alone, though. That old man you keep around? Bring him in. If you two can
        pull this off, I\u2019ll make sure the church looks at you differently."
    - name: Carlo
      sentences:
      - What kind of task are we talking here ?
    - name: Evangelic
      sentences:
      - Later... first i'll suggest you ask your old friend about the offer, i'll
        be right here.
    flagToSetOnComplete: TalkedWithEvangalic
  - requiredFlag: SilivioAngry
    dialogues:
    - name: Evangalic
      sentences:
      - Glad your're back, so what do you say ?
    - name: Carlo
      sentences:
      - "Silvio won\u2019t come. He\u2019s not well. So\u2026 tell me. What\u2019s
        the task?"
    - name: Evangalic
      sentences:
      - Poor Silvio... God can only help those who atleast try to help themselves...
        Anyway, you see there is a small issue that i want resolved i hope you can
        manage on your own.
    - name: Carlo
      sentences:
      - Depends on the issue. Tell me everything atleast, want to make sure i'm not
        walking into my own death.
    - name: Evangalic
      sentences:
      - "There\u2019s a man we call \u201CIssac.\u201D Respected in the church. Some
        gang rats thought it wise to steal from him. The church avoids conflict,
        but you\u2026 you\u2019re not bound by our code. Retrieve what was taken,
        and I\u2019ll vouch for you in the court of the faithful. I\u2019ll see that
        stain on your name \u2014 that \u201Cfag tag\u201D \u2014 erased."
    - name: Carlo
      sentences:
      - "So that\u2019s it. You don\u2019t want to dirty your own hands in gang business\u2026
        so you send me instead?"
    - name: Evangelic
      sentences:
      - "Careful, boy. Don\u2019t mistake wisdom for cowardice. Do this, and the
        church doors will open for you. Refuse\u2026 and the roof is all you\u2019ll
        ever have. That\u2019s your choice.\r\n"
    - name: Evangelic
      sentences:
      - "You\u2019ll find the thief near the camp at night. Look for a red stash.
        And remember \u2014 if you get caught, keep your mouth shut. The fewer enemies
        you make in this place, the longer you live."
    - name: Evangelic
      sentences:
      - Meet me near the garbage dump area, i'll be waiting...
    flagToSetOnComplete: ToThugCamp
  defaultDialogues: []
  defaultFlagToSet: 
  isNarator: 0
  dialogueManager: {fileID: 0}
