--- !u!114 &1650047342
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1650047338}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: dde86f84792f91f4989544a6d4e6ef36, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  conditionalDialogues:
  - requiredFlag: IsDown
    dialogues:
    - name: Carlo
      sentences:
      - You alright, old man?
    - name: Silvio
      sentences:
      - "You\u2019re a damn fool, kid. I told you \u2014 don\u2019t jump into storms
        that ain\u2019t yours."
    - name: Carlo
      sentences:
      - What was I supposed to do? Just watch him beat you half to death?
    - name: Silvio
      sentences:
      - "Yes. That\u2019s exactly what you were supposed to do. In here\u2026 you
        stick your nose where it don\u2019t belong, you pay the price. Now look at
        you. Bleeding for nothing."
    - name: Carlo
      sentences:
      - Bleeding for nothing? Then why the hell were they beating you in the first
        place? You looked ready to die out there!
    - name: Silvio
      sentences:
      - Why the f#%k do you care, huh?
    - name: Carlo
      sentences:
      - "What do you mean, why do I care? You\u2019re the one who told me to build
        a crew, to stand a chance! That\u2019s what we\u2019ve been grinding at for
        the last damn month. And now you turn around and ask me why I give a damn?"
    - name: Silvio
      sentences:
      - "They beat me because of the obvious\u2026 I tried to escape last night."
    - name: Carlo
      sentences:
      - Escape? Out of nowhere, just like that?
    - name: Silvio
      sentences:
      - "Out of nowhere? Kid, you\u2019ve been here a month. I\u2019ve been rotting
        on this roof for two years. I\u2019ve seen things you couldn\u2019t even
        wrap your head around. To them, you, me, every Renegade up here\u2026 we\u2019re
        worth less than half a pound of crack.\r\n"
      - "I\u2019m tired, Carlo. Tired of this life. Tired of being treated like dirt.
        Every damn day it\u2019s the same \u2014 fight, scrape, bleed\u2026 for what?
        Another sunrise in this cage? \r\n"
      - '*Sigh...* I''ll take some rest now, i''ll suggest you do the same.'
    - name: Silvio
      sentences:
      - 'Yea you should take some rest. I have to take care of dinner today. I''ll
        catch up with you at night.

'
    flagToSetOnComplete: GetBeaten
  defaultDialogues: []
  defaultFlagToSet: 
  isNarator: 0
  dialogueManager: {fileID: 0}
