--- !u!114 &1863418156
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1863418153}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: dde86f84792f91f4989544a6d4e6ef36, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  conditionalDialogues:
  - requiredFlag: Default
    dialogues:
    - name: Silvio
      sentences:
      - "So\u2026 you\u2019re the new one they tossed up here. Pathetic sight for
        a kid your age. Word is, you\u2019ve been a little too friendly with the
        other\u2026 guys"
    - name: Carlo
      sentences:
      - All that's a lie !!! I've done no such thing..!! Martin will pay for what
        he did....
    - name: Silvio
      sentences:
      - "Woah, woah\u2026 we\u2019ve got a feisty one. Careful, kid. Best keep that
        barking low."
    - name: Carlo
      sentences:
      - "Oh yeah? And if I don\u2019t?"
    - name: Silvio
      sentences:
      - "Then don\u2019t be surprised if your last bark comes sooner than you think"
    - name: Carlo
      sentences:
      - "What\u2019s that supposed to mean?"
    - name: Silvio
      sentences:
      - "It means this place runs on rules, carved in blood. Ignore them, and you
        won\u2019t live to see another sunrise. So listen close kid cause you'll
        be needing this.\r"
      - "First thing, up here, you\u2019re a Renegade. That means you\u2019re lower
        than dirt. You don\u2019t get respect, you don\u2019t get friends \u2014
        you take what you can and keep your head down."
      - "Don\u2019t go borrowing what you can\u2019t pay back. Don\u2019t mouth off
        to the wrong people. And whatever you do\u2026 don\u2019t look desperate.
        Desperation? That\u2019s blood in the water."
      - "Now, it ain\u2019t all bad. You find a crew, even a small one, you stand
        a chance. You find shelter, you stand a chance."
      - "But remember this above all else: nothing in Tocor\xF3n is free. Every favor\u2019s
        a chain. Every smile\u2019s a blade. Even breathing here comes with a price
        \u2014 they call it la causa, the prison tax. You pay, or you bleed. Simple
        as that."
      - "You wanna live long enough to climb off this roof? Learn who owns the shadows\u2026
        and who you can never cross, like the Martin guy you were cursing a few moment
        ago,he\u2019s no small-time punk. He\u2019s a thug with teeth. If you don\u2019t
        watch your tongue, kid, you\u2019ll find out fast just how sharp those teeth
        can cut."
    flagToSetOnComplete: InitialNaration
  - requiredFlag: TalkedWithEvangalic
    dialogues:
    - name: Carlo
      sentences:
      - "Hey\u2026 how you holding up ?"
    - name: Silvio
      sentences:
      - "I\u2019ll live. Been through worse. What\u2019s with that look, kid? Something
        happen?"
    - name: Carlo
      sentences:
      - "I just talked to one of the evangelics. He\u2019s offering me a way off
        this roof. A real shot. But I need your help."
    - name: Silvio
      sentences:
      - "A shot? Or a noose? Whatever they\u2019re asking, it\u2019s never free,
        kid. You know that."
    - name: Carlo
      sentences:
      - "Nothing here is free. But staying up here, waiting to get picked off one
        day\u2014that\u2019s certain death. This\u2026 this is a chance."
    - name: Silvio
      sentences:
      - "And what? You think you can bargain with those holy men? They\u2019ll use
        you, same as everyone else. The second you slip, you\u2019re done."
    - name: Carlo
      sentences:
      - "Then I\u2019ll do it alone."
    - name: Silvio
      sentences:
      - "I figured you\u2019d say that. And I can\u2019t stop you. But listen\u2014guys
        who chase hope too hard in this place? They don\u2019t make it far. They
        end up dead\u2026 or worse."
    - name: Carlo
      sentences:
      - "I respect you, Silvio. I really do. That\u2019s why I want you with me.
        My father used to tell me, \u2018If you never try, you\u2019ll never fly.\u2019
        Just a little courage, Silvio\u2014that\u2019s all it takes. Come on."
    - name: Silvio
      sentences:
      - "You\u2019ve got more courage than most grown men I\u2019ve met, Carlo. But
        this place\u2026 it stole mine a long time ago. I\u2019m sorry, kid. I can\u2019t
        help you."
    - name: Carlo
      sentences:
      - Alright. I leave tonight. Wish me luck.
    - name: Silvio
      sentences:
      - "You have my wishes, kid. You\u2019ll need every bit of it."
    flagToSetOnComplete: SilivioAngry
  - requiredFlag: MeetAfterAWeek
    dialogues:
    - name: Silvio
      sentences:
      - Are you alright ?
    - name: Carlo
      sentences:
      - Yes I was sent to this place because of theft..remember ?
    - name: Silvio
      sentences:
      - I hope things don't fold in your wrong turn.
    - name: Carlo
      sentences:
      - No one saw me, i'll be fine. All i hope for now is...that church man keeps
        his words true.
    - name: Silvio
      sentences:
      - Deception is the biggest sport here Carlo. Who might look kind from the front
        might be your doom. Beware !
    - name: Silvio
      sentences:
      - I'll keep that in mind, let's see what the future holds...
    flagToSetOnComplete: WeekComplete
  - requiredFlag: EvangalicTask
    dialogues:
    - name: Silvio
      sentences:
      - It's getting hard to pay the 'causa'.
    - name: Carlo
      sentences:
      - You are right... This tax is a real nightmare specially when others don't
        even want to talk to you.
    flagToSetOnComplete: GoingToBeEvangalic
  defaultDialogues: []
  defaultFlagToSet: 
  isNarator: 0
  dialogueManager: {fileID: 0}
